=== BUILDING THE CLEAN LAYER (header removed, records normalised) ===
The clean layer fixes two concrete problems that break Hive reads:
  1. Hive 4.2.1's OpenCSVSerde does not honour skip.header.line.count, so a
     header left in place is read as a data row and inflates every count.
  2. olist_order_reviews_dataset.csv embeds newlines inside quoted comment
     fields. Hive reads one line per record, so those rows fail with
     CsvMalformedLineException: Unterminated quoted field at end of CSV line.
/olist/raw keeps the files exactly as downloaded; /olist/clean holds the
same records, re-serialised by a real CSV parser onto one line each.

